# GitCom Project - Industrial‑Grade Minimal Git Ignore
# Strictly filters runtime junk/cache only, keeps all source code & versioned assets

# Python compiled cache artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Temporary backup & runtime scratch files
*bkp*
*.temp
*.tmp

# macOS system junk & editor artifacts
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# Auto‑generated runtime state snapshots
latest_struct_snap.txt
planned_temp_commit.txt

# Log files & debug outputs
*.log
